            <abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>Updates were performed by comparing the current features with three inch resolution ortho-rectified aerial imagery collected in 2019 for the eastern half of the County and in 2020 for the western half of the County. Digital imagery acquisition was completed between 16th January through 13th February, 2019, and 4th February through 7th March, 2020. Imagery for the planimetric updates was shared by the Mobile County Revenue Commission.</gco:CharacterString>
            </abstract>
            <purpose>
                <gco:CharacterString>Railroads within Mobile County, Alabama.

Railroads outside Mobile County - US Census TIGER data.  In 2020-2021, the features were updated in 2D by The Atlantic Group.</gco:CharacterString>
            </purpose>
